{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:90f64fba5c421436b705fa71e170394423a044fba00f249c5ae6a772078ff378",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70784edd450e03aa6a5d3af95e5405f7d5fb4ee41390df6c9c688d5e1e1f933a",
      "text": "为了谁的生日派对",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11580911dcf0efef2561b87ffa6d19e8570a5b3c07f94f2a65d408e8ca3db0fb",
      "text": "道流和制作人正为武的生日派对做准备，\n而涟却在一旁无所事事。\n他们借由慰问便当探查武的口味偏好，推进筹备。\n生日派对能否顺利举行呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71a57fd666e4269092a2dd10811548765369b82924a77b3b9b149eda2c2a4e0e",
      "text": "接下来要大炸特炸鸡块了！\n涟也来帮把手吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2209c170e8734aaf6d862853a96e6cebb101a7a16f427bd461bc032a10b02cb1",
      "text": "麻烦死了。\n本大爷只管吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e79baef5f5ce9717c5f97c9d00dde5f2fba0b8cde4228d68ff97bd28ef415d0",
      "text": "好啦好啦别这么说嘛。为了能装下\n很多炸鸡块，能帮我拿最大的盘子过来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c8d842ececdbb988201308c6d03f136e98f8c416e0aaf40f10d0cc7dcc8a289",
      "text": "我很期待最强大天才涟挑出来的\n最强的大盘子哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1ea38505b83c1c0429ffcc7bc2325bac22e6d19b5eaf933668044fd4f9fcb5f",
      "text": "哼。没办法。\n就由本大爷来选出最强的盘子吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de7433ed46edfd9209b4404f431216d3413c6692cc3e54a44e677c992aed3171",
      "text": "圆城寺先生，是为了今天\n才去研究料理的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc5d72bef33e5660077f2d23f0705bfb39251621c0627a1f3fa174c1fd49a6a2",
      "text": "哈哈，其实是这样啦。\n特意调查了武喜欢的调味呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97b35f5b05e7f3384d87aab82a34b37abed21fb12634270b4269ed1eb01d1828",
      "text": "还合你心意吗？一不小心干劲太足，\n可能做得有点多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35efa4a0154063609614370c9cfdc171eba99525fbb82edfea3c0ecabeccc067",
      "text": "每道菜都很好吃。\n好吃到我都想再多吃点了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a32aafba662b9f6eb57e7c4a84a538ae4da9290f67373b40bec46b2e020ac70a",
      "text": "这样啊！要添饭的话还有很多，\n尽管放开吃吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bee8535a9809a4d2f6f003e4d651c527ff27fe4b72b4c60f2de542ceb57ad94a",
      "text": "本大爷特意来参加派对了，\n好好感谢我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27a932c99df85ae78e432f5626b311e214c89dade7d2b38aacdf0315262264eb",
      "text": "我又没求你来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bfb4553b99812f9568fb4131429375c6d5f1fd38810f42b471c1e1da8dbc426",
      "text": "你说什么啊混蛋！？本大爷准备的盘子\n明明是最强的吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b39aa38d6625ea9f6b1ee308cfa6f9aaeff45e9bb4e4635faf6cf69237d129f",
      "text": "你也就干了那点事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_038tak_2_1_2_038_12:1_2_038_12_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e7766680cdc4ef0b95347a189a9556a2dd15baec2ad0def2ff2f0232b37ed14",
      "text": "不过，这个派对我挺开心的。\n……谢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
